    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Reynolds Estate Agents are delighted to present to the market this impressive four-bedroom semi-detached residence, ideally positioned within the ever-popular Tonaphubble area of Sligo.\n\nExtending to approximately c. 125 m2, this well-proportioned family home offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout, perfectly suited to modern living. \n\nThe layout includes a large welcoming entrance hall, generous living space, a fully fitted kitchen/dining area, along with the added convenience of a guest WC on the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the property comprises four well-appointed bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, together with a main family bathroom.\n\nThe property enjoys a prime position overlooking a well-maintained green area, providing a pleasant and open outlook. To the front, there is a low-maintenance garden with off-street parking, ensuring both practicality and ease of upkeep.\n\nLocated within walking distance of Sligo town centre, the property benefits from immediate access to a wide range of local amenities including schools, shops, healthcare services, and public transport links.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a quality family home in a sought-after residential location.\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\n\nLarge Hall Entrance\ntiled\n\nLounge - 5.63m (18'6\") x 3.85m (12'8\")\nsolid fuel fireplace / piped for gas\nbay window\ntimber floor\n\nDining Room - 3.77m (12'4\") x 2.88m (9'5\")\npatio doors to rear garden\ntimber floor\n\nKitchen - 5.41m (17'9\") x 2.25m (7'5\")\nbuilt in kitchen with all mod cons\ntiled floor\n\nGuest Toilet - 1.99m (6'6\") x 1m (3'3\")\nwc & whb\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 3m (9'10\") x 2.42m (7'11\")\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.36m (14'4\") x 3.2m (10'6\")\n\nEn-Suite - 3.16m (10'4\") x 0.89m (2'11\")\nwc, whb & electric shower\npartial tiling\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m (9'10\") x 2.76m (9'1\")\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.09m (10'2\") x 2.87m (9'5\")\n\nBathroom - 2m (6'7\") x 1.64m (5'5\")\nwc, whb & shower/bath\nfully tiled\n\nHot Press\nwalk-in\n\nNotice\nThese particulars are issued by David Reynolds Estate Agent on the understanding that any negotiations relating to the property are conducted through them. Whilst every care is taken in preparing particulars, the Company do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracy in the particulars or the terms of the properties referred to or for any expense that may be incurred in visiting same should it prove unsuitable or to have been let, sold or withdrawn. Applicants are advised to make an appointment through us before viewing and are respectfully requested to report their opinion after inspection."
      },
